<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Olsten cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Olsten cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said the rating on Olsten Corp was cut to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares were down 5-1/8 to 14-3/4 in late morning trade.</p>
</text>
